WEBVTT

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:34.230
Valentine.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:37.990
It is not the name of a baseball team's coach.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.230
It's a day of love that only comes once a year.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:47.820
A sweet and sour day overflowing with dreams, hopes, curses and apathy.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:58.300
Valentine's Day originated in 269 AD when the Roman emperor persecuted Saint Valentine.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:05.800
The first chocolate to be given to a lover was in 1868 by an English...

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.940
Well, let's leave that aside.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.300
Bird bullying.

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:19.750
Speaking of February, it's the Eve of Spring

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.450
Then I'll see you on Sunday.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.120
Yeah. Thank you.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.410
Later!

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:26.490
What for?

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:29.950
Ah, she wanted me to teach her how to make guchu balls.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:32.270
I'm going too.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.230
No.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.340
Why not?

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.040
You're probably going to put something raw into the pot again.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.750
I won't put something like that in. That's too much of a waste.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.120
No means no!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:55.940
While the "Seven Emotions" may be a short story, it's actually a very old story.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:03.100
It's different from the "Seven Emotions" of the Tokugawa family...

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:20.990
All right, stop there.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.090
Next is... Kirihara, continue reading.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:25.560
Kirihara?

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.580
Teacher! I'll read for him!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:51.960
Senpai!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.840
Takamimori-senpai... Um...

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.520
Here...

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.370
Thank you.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:25.300
But...

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.070
Please don't say it.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:32.520
I know... I know about it all.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:37.230
If I knew I wasn't good enough, then I shouldn't have fallen in love.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:46.070
At that time, what was floating around in Kyo's mind was the girl with long hair that was always with her.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:52.110
And then she became aware of the feelings in her heart.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.230
Please tell me clearly!

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:00.770
Just exactly what are you to Takamimori-sempai!?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.790
I'm just a friend.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.250
Yes, what brings us together is...

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.360
The duty to protect Earth as warriors.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.690
Well, we do what we are supposed to do, five times a week.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:20.390
5 Times a Week?

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.580
Ah, chocolate?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.950
It's almost time for Valentine's.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.810
Guess I'll get one.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:45.790
We're here anyway.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:50.970
Good.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:53.010
She seems to have good taste.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.570
When it comes to chocolate, it has to be Belgian.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:56.960
Here, you too.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:05.990
Va-len-tine?

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.130
Yeah, it's Valentine.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.710
Hey, who are you going to give it to?

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.660
That's a secret!

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:15.730
It's the day when women say "I love you" to men in Japan.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.740
You usually give them chocolate too.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:37.320
Ah, you're back?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.150
What is it, mochi mochi?

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:50.920
Cho-cho-cho to Su-nao.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.860
Cho-cho-cho to Su-nao.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:58.920
Cho-cho-cho to Su-nao.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.370
Well, it's about time I go back to Africa.

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.570
Ah, Moriyama-san, going back already?

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:18.970
Yes. Please take care of Sunao.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.730
O-Okay. Take care.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.830
Okay!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.710
Hey! Hey! You can't follow me.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.470
Go back to Sunao.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.450
Ah, I get it.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.330
I'll buy you something as a farewell gift.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:37.980
What do you want?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.020
This is nice! Can I get this, mister?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:52.400
Hey, let go. I guess I'm popular.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:56.060
Please think about it well! This is important!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.760
I just can't fail!

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:02.980
Making her happy with sweet chocolate....

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.470
Or having her tiptoe to reach the chocolate...

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.530
Which method do you think will captivate her?

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.310
How about you try both?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.860
H-H-How about a kiss? Can I try that too?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.990
I'll call the cops on you.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.540
At least stay and have a meal.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:44.280
And finally, it's February 14th.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.000
We're lucky we have gym today.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.970
While the boys aren't here, let's put them in their desks.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.390
Let's hand them out quickly! Quickly!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.840
You really splurged on them huh, Ei-chan?

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.680
Here's some chocolate for you too, Pote-chan.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.380
You're sleeping?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.050
Obtained chocolate while sleeping.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.610
Eat it later, okay?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.970
Potemayo got chocolate!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.900
A quick bird attack!

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.410
You're stupid, Kyo. To get yourself killed...

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:57.560
It's fine...

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.440
If I didn't do this, I would've lost you.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.840
And I've already sinned a long time ago.

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:10.220
Nene, I've sinned the moment I fell in love with you.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.480
Kyo...

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.090
This is a lie...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.680
Kyo, please...

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:24.460
Answer me! Don't leave me behind!

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:33.420
Guchuko! I brought you some guchu balls.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.830
You were here, Nene?

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.030
Guchuko?

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:38.900
Yeah, right there... Huh?

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:49.240
Sweet milk chocolate with a silver accessory. It's quite perfect if I say so myself.

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:56.020
All right, guess I'll run a simulation here.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:00.600
I chose this while thinking of you.

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.820
Will you accept these feelings of mine?

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:05.550
Sure!

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:27.170
Hey, why is Kirihara carrying your stuff?

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:28.660
It's a secret.

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:30.580
Mudo!

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.430
What's wrong? You don't seem well.

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:50.090
I see, Sunao. You're lonely now because you're beloved dad has gone away.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:56.030
Sunao! I'm sorry for surprising you! I apologize! Sunao!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.710
I wanted to see the sights and hear the crowds, that's all!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:04.390
I wanted to see the touching Valentine's Day performances! Right? Right?!

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:58.110
Sneezy Morning

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:01.840
Let me see.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.710
You'll have to stay home today.

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:17.400
What should I do about my uniform?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:23.460
You took a bath last night and then watched TV without wearing clothes, right?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.650
You were doing some weird dance too.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.670
No, you didn't have to dance for me.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.500
You then got chilly.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.370
Warm up and sleep.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.200
Once you wake up it'll be evening.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.910
I'll be home then, okay?

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.150
Later.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:17.440
Potemayo?

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.330
Hey, give them to me.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.140
Potemayo?

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:28.660
I see. You're worried, huh?

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.640
Your father already went to Africa?

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:33.730
Yeah.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.960
I wonder if Potemayo-chan will be okay.

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:45.490
Suna-o. Suna-o. Suna-o.

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.290
Can I visit her on the way home?

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:54.000
Ah, that can't happen.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.370
Moriyama-kun?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.210
Su-nao.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.560
Morning, Mikan.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.790
Morning.

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.130
Poteko isn't here today.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:49.390
Pote-chan caught a cold.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.460
It was cold last night.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.100
Well, how's her condition?

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:59.110
It seems to be pretty bad.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:04.290
So I'm going to visit her on the way home, right, Moriyama-kun?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.570
Moriyama's over there.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.930
He's the one who seems to have it bad.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:17.760
Moriyama-kun!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:21.340
Correct. It's the first time I've seen this formula, but it seems effective.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:25.920
If I had to say the problem then... Let's see...

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.260
We're in geography class right now.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:31.680
What's wrong with Moriyama?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:33.570
Get back to your seat and open your geography textbook to page 15.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.700
Pote-chan seems to be sick.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.360
I heard, Moriyama. Potemayo is sick?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.080
Once you finish lunch you can go home.

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:41.530
But...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:42.600
It's okay, go home.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.140
Moriyama!

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.220
This is for Pote.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.130
Moriyama-kun, you're going home?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.210
"Take care of yourself."

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.780
That's what my slave said.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.640
Thanks.

00:17:56.770 --> 00:18:05.440
Please give her my regards! Then tell her that my heart will always be for her even though I've been violated!

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.890
Hey, slave! Tea!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:09.490
Mudo!

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.370
Suna-o. Suna-o.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.970
Suna-o?

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:06.240
Su-nao! Suna-o!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.060
Su-nao. Suna-o.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:42.130
Su-nao. Suna-o.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.300
Su-nao...

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:54.060
Potemayo! I'm back.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:57.850
Potemayo!

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.010
Potemayo!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:02.040
Hey!

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.390
What is it? You're such a fond kid.

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.420
Well, but...

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.110
I guess we both are.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.750
How warm.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.030
She wet herself.

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.090
How is Pote-chan doing?

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:49.980
I came to make dinner. Can we come in?

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:50.940
Yeah.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.140
We're coming in!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.080
Huh? Why are you wearing a jersey?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:04.410
Your nose is all runny. Eat a lot and get better.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:05.940
Here.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:13.050
Here, one more bite.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:14.940
She's really chewing on it, huh?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:22.170
I'm deeply moved by Mudo's love for her.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.210
It's a bit disturbing though.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.460
Next Day

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:31.300
Moriyama-san!

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:32.400
Yes.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:36.130
You take one pouch of this medicine after every meal.

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:36.870
Okay.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:39.880
You take this one when you have a high fever.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:40.680
Okay.

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:45.370
Half a pouch for Potemayo and a pouch for me.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.900
Ah, we're matching.

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:30.260
Next episode is about Guchuko and a cuckoo clock.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:32.080
Kyo-chan's mother makes things work.

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:34.370
And then, a new character appears.

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:35.010
Next episode,

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.850
Deep Sleep Remembrance.

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.000
Spring Storm.

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:39.660
Please look forward to it!
